OCPP JSON Schemas — vendored, unmodified
========================================

These JSON Schema files are published by the Open Charge Alliance (OCA)
as part of the Open Charge Point Protocol specifications and are
redistributed here byte-for-byte unmodified. They are NOT covered by the
MIT/Apache-2.0 licenses that apply to the Rust code in this repository.

  schemas/v16/   OCPP 1.6 (edition 2 + errata) — 78 files, JSON Schema draft-04
                 © Open Charge Alliance. Published with the OCPP 1.6 specification.
  schemas/v201/  OCPP 2.0.1 FINAL — 128 files, JSON Schema draft-06
                 © Open Charge Alliance. Published with OCPP 2.0.1 Part 2.
  schemas/v21/   OCPP 2.1 Edition 1 — 181 files, JSON Schema draft-06
                 (c) OCA, Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0
                 International Public License, as stated in each file's
                 "comment" field.

Only the OCPP 2.1 files carry an explicit license statement. The 1.6 and
2.0.1 files carry none, and are redistributed as they appear in the OCA
publications and in https://github.com/mobilityhouse/ocpp (MIT), the source
they were copied from on 2026-08-30. The OCPP specification PDFs are not
redistributed with this repository.

Open Charge Alliance: https://openchargealliance.org/
